 h Breath & Mantra). Then moves to Tāĺāsana to Savasana then Seated Prā
 nāyāma (Yogic Breathing) including Morning Cleansing Kriyas\, Ujjayi\, N
 adi Shuddi\, Samantraka Prānāyāma\, Pratyahara\, Dharana. May include S
 pecific Mudra (Energetic Bodily Gestures).
