DESCRIPTION:Nataraja School of Traditional Yoga\n**Yoga Vinyasa Krama - Th
 ursdays 9-10:30am**\n**Songbird Community Healing Center Cotati**\n**RSVP 
 ONLY**\nPhysical Health\, Conditioning\, Pranic Flow\, Vital Energy\, Ment
 al Focus & Stillness - through intelligent architecture with the metaphysi
 cs of deep conscious breathing & slow motion\, yogic breathwork\, mantra/s
 ound/vibration\, mudra\, subtle & contemplative practices.\nYoga Vinyasa K
 rama is a comprehensive hatha-raja yogic system for purification\, develop
 ing concentration\, neuromuscular fitness and conditioning\, refining & ma
 stering the breath\, awakening subtle energy and stilling the mind. Based 
 on deep breathing & the subtle movement of prana directed into the cartila
 ge tissue\, sinuous musculature\, internal organs\, nerve pathways and nad
 is. It has over 700 intelligently sequenced slow\, conscious breath powere
 d with precision movement variations with pause (vinyasas)\, exploring man
 y aesthetic variations of each posture to correctly establish the main asa
 nas while the mind merges with the breath.\nIncludes the energetics of dri
 shti\, pratikriyas\, bandha\, vaseth\, mudra\, mantra\, surya & ding namas
 kar with breath & mantra\, cleansing kriyas\, Himalayan pranayama includin
 g including ujjayi variations\, heating & cooling breaths\, solar\, lunar 
 & soli-lunar nadi shuddhi practices\, pranava & samantraka pranayama\, pra
 tyahara\, subtle & contemplative practices in 12 kramas (sequences).\nThe 
 whole process gradually transforms the body and mind\, releasing old patte
 rns of physical and mental tension and dysfunctional patterns of movement\
 , providing tonic\, energetic and psychophysiological effects.\nThis syste
 m is presented from the teachings **Srivatsa Ramaswami** learned through h
 is over 33 years of one on one study with **Sri Krishnamacharya** and teac
 hings from a similar **Himalayan method**.\nThis ongoing class will explor
 e the entire system of 12 Kramas with each class focusing on a particular 
 krama or vinyasas from different kramas & pranayama & dharana practices.\n
 Please practice on an empty stomach. Morning beverage ok but please take i
 t 30min or more before class.\n***Certain injuries & health issues may be 
 contraindicated Please contact me if you have a concern***\nKnowledge of U
 jjayi Breathing recommended\n**$25 Drop In\, Discounted Class Passes\, Sli
 ding Scale Available**\n\\*\\***RSVP Only** Contact Kara @707-235-1413\, [
